------------------------------------------------------------

Q3. Can the Watch Window monitor expressions as well as variables?

Answer

Yes.

It can monitor both variables and expressions added by the developer.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q4. Which window is useful for monitoring only a few important variables?

Answer

The Watch Window.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q5. Which window automatically updates based on the current scope?

Answer

The Locals Window.

